@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
title S06-ddd-sequence — source snapshot (not a runtime trace)
participant "obj: 调用者" as obj
participant "ctl: RoleController" as ctl
participant "svc: RoleApplicationService" as svc
participant "auth: AuthorizationApplicationService" as auth
participant "role: Role" as role
participant "repo: AuthorizationRepository" as repo
participant "audit: AuditApplicationService" as audit
participant "integrity: GrantIntegrityService" as integrity
participant "auditRepo: AuditRepository" as auditRepo
participant "graph: RoleHierarchy" as graph
activate obj
obj -> ctl: 1. status(bearer, id, input)
activate ctl
ctl -> svc: 2. status(principal, id, enabled)
activate svc
group same local transaction: business + integrity + version + SUCCESS audit
svc -> repo: 3. lockGrants()
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> auth: 4. require(principal, rbac:role:edit, true)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> repo: 5. role(id)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> auth: 6. requireRoleManagement(actor, role)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> role: 7. changeStatus(enabled)
activate role
deactivate role
opt enabling
svc -> svc: 8. requireAffectedGrants(actor, graph, changedRole, permissions)
activate svc
svc -> graph: 9. affectedBy(changedRole.id())
activate graph
deactivate graph
loop changed role and every affected senior
svc -> auth: 10. requireGraphGrant(actor, graph, affectedId)
activate auth
deactivate auth
svc -> auth: 11. upperBound(actor, systemCode, proposedClosure)
activate auth
deactivate auth
end
note over auth
All checks precede saveRole/saveEdges; actor facts still precede mutation.
Special-capability traversal includes disabled nodes.
end note
deactivate svc
end
svc -> repo: 12. saveRole(role)
activate repo
deactivate repo
svc -> integrity: 13. requireAdministrator()
activate integrity
deactivate integrity
note over integrity
active identities + root department + role eligibility
+ current graph/permissions → LastAdministratorPolicy.
No qualified effective SUPER_ADMIN → 409; outer transaction rolls back.
end note
svc -> repo: 14. advanceVersion()
activate repo
deactivate repo
alt audit persistence throws
svc -> audit: 15. local(actor, system, ROLE_STATUS_CHANGED, target, SUCCESS, null)
activate audit
audit -> auditRepo: 16. append(fact)
activate auditRepo
auditRepo --> obj: persistence failure; rollback, no business success
deactivate auditRepo
deactivate audit
else persisted in caller transaction
svc -> audit: 17. local(actor, system, ROLE_STATUS_CHANGED, target, SUCCESS, null)
activate audit
audit -> auditRepo: 18. append(fact)
activate auditRepo
deactivate auditRepo
deactivate audit
note over audit
DDD local derives actual actor identity-role snapshot before append.
No independent SUCCESS commit; timestamps have millisecond precision.
end note
end
end
note over svc
Spring interceptor COMMIT after normal method return; failure blocks success response.
end note
note over audit
denied is a separate REQUIRES_NEW DENIED event, not business SUCCESS.
AOP method/log timing is neither audit_log nor proof of DB commit.
end note
deactivate svc
deactivate ctl
deactivate obj
@enduml